[{"client_msg_id":"d75eb64e-df26-4937-a0bd-40b62dbcd06d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あと、おもいたったことがなんでも投入できる(各段階のプロセスに)とか都合を気にせずに作業できるとかか...\nまあ、まさしく趣味なわけだけど","ts":"1629502186.080600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":3,"users":["U013QL1RAPN","U9S4G0LJW","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G=l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"feaeb095-8ae0-42f6-bb84-3959f0d61269","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"電気電子学科だったので、学生実験のときに半導体プロセスやりました\nまあ危ないので大学院生が作業するのを後ろから眺めてただけなんですがw\n自前でできない部分があって外注もしていて、全部はできないのかーって思った覚えがある","ts":"1629473822.079600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TYNuo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f723247-c4e9-46db-a964-0684e12202a9","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"教育目的では、プロセスできる範囲が多いとよいことですけどね","ts":"1629473716.076600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KK0rF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"38123a1a-7cee-4d32-aa68-ab2a90a99a02","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"趣味と研究の違いか","ts":"1629473649.075900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hJ2qA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e8ab5e91-7f84-40c4-9a3a-8d7c54379c4c","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"研究室単位での話をするなら、通しで作れること自体には意味が薄くて\n何らかの意味で新規性のあるデバイス製造できなくては何の意味もないので\nメインで取り組んでいること以外は外注でも全然おかしくないですね","ts":"1629473489.074500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s6l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2e07052a-dbcc-45ea-b8e9-a3c41cd7eab1","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"しかしロマンのある話だなあ","ts":"1629473298.070400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XaX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1394812c-5188-43ff-b7a6-7eeb12d599f4","type":"message","user":"U01D9B